§ `ss 5 to 11`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `taking part in an illegal industrial action` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `taking part in an illegal lockout` EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `instigating an illegal industrial action or lockout` EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `a union penalising a member who refused` EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `unlawful picketing` EQUALS 2000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `taking part in an illegal industrial action` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `taking part in an illegal lockout` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `instigating an illegal industrial action or lockout` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `a union penalising a member who refused` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `intimidation` EQUALS 3

